---
layout: base.njk
isPost: true
nav: journal
---
<div class="post-heading"><a href="/journal/">返回航海日志</a><h1>{{ title }}</h1><p>{{ description }}</p><div class="post-meta"><span>{{ site.author }}</span><a href="/categories/{{ category | slugify }}/">{{ category }}</a><time datetime="{{ page.date.toISOString() }}">{{ page.date | dateText }}</time><span>约 {{ content | readTime }} 分钟</span></div></div>
<div class="article-layout section-wrap"><aside class="toc"><h2>本页航线</h2><nav aria-label="文章目录">{% for entry in content | toc %}<a class="toc-level-{{ entry.level }}" href="#{{ entry.id }}">{{ entry.text }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav></aside><div class="article-main"><img class="post-cover" src="/assets/images/crew-{{ cover }}.webp" alt="海贼王主题配图" width="1920" height="1080">{% if sample %}<p class="sample-notice">内容样例：用于预览博客阅读效果，不代表作者的真实经历或技术成果。</p>{% endif %}<article class="prose">{{ content | safe }}</article><div class="post-end"><div class="tag-cloud">{% for topic in topics %}<a href="/tags/{{ topic | slugify }}/">#{{ topic }}</a>{% endfor %}</div><button type="button" class="text-button copy-link">复制文章链接</button><span class="copy-status" role="status"></span></div><section class="comments" data-comments data-repo="{{ site.repo }}" data-slug="{{ page.fileSlug }}" aria-labelledby="comments-title"><h2 id="comments-title">船上的留言</h2><p>读完这一页，有什么想聊的？</p><div class="comment-list" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="comment-status" role="status">留言由 GitHub 保存，加载中…</p><div class="comment-actions"><a class="button" data-comment-link href="https://github.com/{{ site.repo }}/issues/new?title={{ ('[留言] ' + page.fileSlug) | urlencode }}">登录 GitHub 留言</a><button type="button" class="text-button retry-comments" hidden>重新加载</button></div><noscript><p>启用 JavaScript 可在此查看留言，也可直接前往 GitHub 阅读和回复。</p></noscript></section></div></div>
